<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="3a9ba225bb0340f9abf9c05e7687512a">
<p nodeId="2c064b17539643f5af665f10a7d67718"><span font-size="14">加法/减法/乘法/除法/取余</span></p>
<ol nodeId="9ac9d4f8208d4de2a261c0fe821faeb3">
<li nodeId="0ffd8aa1adb54d11adebc755755aa84d"><span font-size="14">针对这5种计算方法，会带出两个输入框，输入框为下拉选项，选项为已经有的指标</span></li>
<li nodeId="c96bcb4472bc4b0c8e0b9bd2a9a50e6a"><span font-size="14">针对除法，四舍五入保留两位小数；</span></li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="def6c14189394217b93cadb8dd82e3c9" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[561]" nodeId="ff6ae537df1b4ae69462ab29481ed427">
