<p nodeId="c6793a639840467b94f048c013229da7"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1226778279/1392291861?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true" name="image.jpeg" width="539" height="361" nodeId="ae2663f2094444a1b09ab44f0eddae27" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="f2181ca25e18442a9eadc7a402dd0627">
<td colwidth="[55]" numCell="true" nodeId="7130c88fdfcc421c95fe1f57b88c222b">
<p nodeId="0c0642cd936b4af3a764dc8e2e344cbc" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="4b3b0a3eca234b9d9d03e07cd73aee4a">
<p nodeId="0600bf236892479e84a80f9f40b64462"><span font-size="14">命中其一累加/命中其一的待评估规则</span></p>
<ol nodeId="4004bc904b704c2aafde20f7dead449e">
<li nodeId="023de78957104f898c6750b35a248429">
<p nodeId="65c4da347a334f01b72c44dc05f8f8e0"><span font-size="14">上述两种算子类似于sql中计数时 where条件的in语法</span></p>
<p nodeId="5e4ed323610c4a56a46eada7af6a29a8"><span font-size="14">select count(*) from table where column_name1 in (condition1, condition2.....)</span></p>
<p nodeId="373cd1040f2444488ffa050b41f4551c"><span font-size="14">区别在于：</span></p>
<p nodeId="fb8a2101930d43599614d7b773f0c237"><span font-size="14">命中其一累加：仅以请求（request_id）维度，统计命中后面条件中的规则的数量</span></p>
<p nodeId="c588b6972afe44589ef5126071f65e90"><span font-size="14">命中其一的待评估规则：仅以请求（request_id）维度，统计命中后面条件中的规则且命中待评估规则的数量</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="674025ec68d74c19bed998a9d0a96c17"><span font-size="14">支持选择规则/规则组，可以多选规则id/规则组id</span></li>
<li nodeId="179a64776bc9495099dabdb453effc09"><span font-size="14">如果选择规则id，后面仅支持多选规则id；</span></li>
<li nodeId="37ae29cacfba461590aec279ddc634a2"><span font-size="14">如果选择规则组id，近支持多选规则组id，实际计算时，会统计规则组里管理的所有规则id</span></li>
</ol>
</td>
<td colwidth="[561]" nodeId="5a5fe412cd5e4ee0be68545bb6d585f8">
